Get job details

Usage: vendo jobs get [OPTIONS] <jobId>

Arguments:
  <jobId>  

Options:
      --json  Output raw JSON
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo jobs get <jobId>
  $ vendo jobs get <jobId> --json
